{
    "title": "myLidl",
    "description": "Save more with myLidl\u2014Lidl\u2019s FREE benefits program for Lidl US customers. Download the app to access exclusive prices, earn rewards and coupons, create personalized grocery lists, receive a special birthday treat, view store-specific ads, product lists, hours and more. First-time app sign-ins receive a $5 off $30 reward!\r\n\r\nExclusive myLidl prices are automatically available to all myLidl members. Coupons, however, must be \u201cclipped\u201d within the app to be applied to your purchase. Once they are clipped, simply scan the app or enter your phone number at checkout for extra savings. Log in to the app to take advantage of rewards and more benefits.\r\n\r\nUse the grocery list feature to:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tCreate custom lists\r\n\u2022\tShare lists with friends and family\r\n\u2022\tView stock availability and aisle information\r\n\r\nUse the recipe feature to:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDiscover delicious recipes that fit your budget\r\n\u2022\tAdd recipe ingredients to custom grocery lists\r\n\r\nOther ways to save time and money with the app:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tScan the app at checkout to redeem, myLidl prices, coupons and rewards\r\n\u2022\tWin rewards for your regular grocery runs\r\n\u2022\tView all current offers\r\n\u2022\tView store-specific product availability and aisle location\r\n\u2022\tSet dietary preferences",
    "descriptionHTML": "Save more with myLidl\u2014Lidl\u2019s FREE benefits program for Lidl US customers. Download the app to access exclusive prices, earn rewards and coupons, create personalized grocery lists, receive a special birthday treat, view store-specific ads, product lists, hours and more. First-time app sign-ins receive a $5 off $30 reward!<br><br>Exclusive myLidl prices are automatically available to all myLidl members. Coupons, however, must be \u201cclipped\u201d within the app to be applied to your purchase. Once they are clipped, simply scan the app or enter your phone number at checkout for extra savings. Log in to the app to take advantage of rewards and more benefits.<br><br>Use the grocery list feature to:<br><br>\u2022\tCreate custom lists<br>\u2022\tShare lists with friends and family<br>\u2022\tView stock availability and aisle information<br><br>Use the recipe feature to:<br><br>\u2022\tDiscover delicious recipes that fit your budget<br>\u2022\tAdd recipe ingredients to custom grocery lists<br><br>Other ways to save time and money with the app:<br><br>\u2022\tScan the app at checkout to redeem, myLidl prices, coupons and rewards<br>\u2022\tWin rewards for your regular grocery runs<br>\u2022\tView all current offers<br>\u2022\tView store-specific product availability and aisle location<br>\u2022\tSet dietary preferences",
